 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Dead ends",
   "items": [
    "Unknown language prefix, agent, blog, industry or comparison slug: the 404 page",
    "Unmatched path: the [...rest] catch-all shows the bilingual 404",
    "A layout render error shows global-error with 'Try again' only"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "slate",
   "title": "No account, no model",
   "items": [
    "Home and pricing are static renders from home.ts and the dictionaries",
    "Home: nothing is read from Redis and no model is called",
    "Prices, credits, seats and chat messages come from the plan table in pricing.ts, never the account",
    "Starter, Pro and Business open signup with no plan param; the account starts on plan 'trial' with 50 credits for 3 days",
    "Agency 'Contact us' opens the contact form at /enterprise#contact",
    "No URL box on the home page: the nav button and plan buttons lead to signup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Model paused",
   "items": [
    "The model is still paused: CLAUDE_PAUSED is true in src/lib/model.ts",
    "Home steps 1, 3, 4, 5 and 6 (Your brand, Plan, Draft, Your approval, Analysis) show a 'Today:' note while it is paused",
    "Turning the model back on removes the notes by itself; the home page never calls a model"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Language",
   "items": [
    "\"/\" uses the nashr_lang cookie, then Accept-Language, else Arabic",
    "The pill keeps the query and hash; the same language is a no-op",
    "Clicked before hydration: a plain link, no cookie, query dropped"
   ]
  }
 ]
